MtMortar_Cave4_Text_BlackBeltKiyo_1::
	.string "Hey!\p"
	.string "I am the KARATE KING!\p"
	.string "I train alone here in the dark!\p"
	.string "You!\n"
	.string "Battle with me!\p"
	.string "Hwaaarggh!$"

MtMortar_Cave4_Text_BlackBeltKiyoDefeat::
	.string "Waaaarggh!\n"
	.string "I’m beaten!$"

MtMortar_Cave4_Text_BlackBeltKiyoVictory::
	.string "Oh, no!\n"
	.string "I overdid it!$"

MtMortar_Cave4_Text_BlackBeltKiyo_2::
	.string "I... I’m crushed...\p"
	.string "My training is still not enough...\p"
	.string "But a loss is a loss. I admit it.\p"
	.string "As proof that you defeated me, I’ll\n"
	.string "give you a rare fighting POKéMON.$"

MtMortar_Cave4_Text_BlackBeltKiyo_3::
	.string "{PLAYER} received TYROGUE.$"

MtMortar_Cave4_Text_BlackBeltKiyo_4::
	.string "TYROGUE is a fighting-type.\p"
	.string "It evolves into tougher POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Keep up the hard work. I’ll keep\n"
	.string "training too.\p"
	.string "Farewell!$"

MtMortar_Cave4_Text_BlackBeltKiyo_5::
	.string "You have no room in your party!$"
